@LAS
Syntax: las <file> [<opts>]
Usage : devsys assembler: NitrOS9's sources (lwasm syntax) and RMA's
        mod or section: lwasm syntax; psect: RMA syntax
Opts  : -o=<path>    write the module or ROF object to path
        -l           print a listing      -s  print the symbol table
        -i=<dir>     look for "use" files in dir as well
        -D<sym>[=val] define sym
        --pragma=<list>  lwasm pragmas, as in NitrOS9's makefiles
        --args=<file>    read more options from file
        --defs=<file>    constants from a ROF object or library
        --defsimg=<file> precompiled defs (recorded on first use)
        --lwasm, --rma   force a syntax
NitrOS9 settings: --args=/dd/sys/n9mod.opt (modules)
                  --args=/dd/sys/n9obj.opt (objects)
See /dd/devsys/README
